  {
   "id": "gid://shopify/Product/6701388103834",
   "title": "Organic Enlighten Mint",
   "description": {
    "html": "A 15.5 fl oz Higher Power Can of ready-to-drink organic yerba mate, Enlighten Mint delivers 150mg of caffeine with cool peppermint and a touch of honey for people who want refreshing, coffee-free energy on the go. Chill, open, and enjoy a smooth lift without brewing, steeping, or mixing. The flavor is crisp and minty, blending organic yerba mate, organic peppermint leaf, organic honey, and organic cane sugar. Each 1-can serving has 120 calories, 0g fat, 0mg sodium, 29g total carbohydrates, 28g total sugars including 28g added sugars, and 1g protein. It is 0% juice, gluten free, KSA Kosher, USDA Organic, B Corp Certified, and made with select fair trade ingredients. Ingredients include filtered water, organic cane sugar, organic yerba mate extract, organic brewed yerba mate and peppermint, organic honey, citric acid, organic mint natural flavor, and organic caffeine. The yerba mate is shade-grown and hand-harvested in South America\u2019s Atlantic Forest, bringing premium quality at a strong everyday value. From Yerba Madre, formerly Guayak\u00ed, this can builds on almost 30 years of sharing yerba mate across loose leaf, cans, and bottles. Enlighten Mint was one of the early ready-to-drink cans after Lemon Elation; the wider Yerba Madre lineup now spans nearly 20 flavors and formats, with more than 10,000 Ambacebadores connecting around mate culture"
