  {
   "id": "gid://shopify/Product/14688464666988",
   "title": "Organic Best Sellers Variety Pack",
   "description": {
    "html": "This Best Sellers Variety Pack is a 12-pack of ready-to-drink organic yerba mate for shoppers who want convenient, flavorful energy without brewing. Each 15.5 fl oz can delivers 150 mg of caffeine, making it an easy grab-and-go choice for work, study, travel, or an afternoon lift. The case includes 4 cans each of three full-sugar favorites: Enlighten Mint, Revel Berry, and Bluephoria. Enlighten Mint blends yerba mate with peppermint and a touch of honey for a cool, refreshing finish. Revel Berry combines yerba mate, hibiscus flower, and yumberry for a bright berry-herbal taste. Bluephoria brings together blueberry, elderberry, and yerba mate for a smooth, fruit-forward option. Each can contains 120 calories, 0 g fat, and 28 g total sugars, with the full-flavor taste expected from a classic sweetened yerba mate. A single case gives you practical variety and premium ready-to-drink quality, so you can stock multiple flavors instead of committing to just one. Made with organic yerba mate that is shade-grown and hand-harvested in South America\u2019s Atlantic Forest, these cans are caffeinated, USDA Organic, gluten free, KSA Kosher, and made with select fair trade ingredients. Formerly Guayak\u00ed and now Yerba Madre, we\u2019ve shared yerba mate in cans, bottles, and loose leaf for almost 30 years, with nearly 20 ready-to-drink flavor options enjoyed across North and South America."
